<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
subsidiaries and the VIE conduct business transactions that include trading activities, provision of services and intercompany advances.
The transactions and cash flows that have occurred between UTime Limited (&ldquo;Parent&rdquo;), VIE and its consolidated subsidiaries
(&ldquo;VIE&rdquo;), UTime WFOE that are the primary beneficiary of the VIE (&ldquo;WFOE&rdquo;), an aggregation of other entities that
are consolidated (&ldquo;other entities&rdquo;) are summarized as the following:&nbsp;</FONT></P>

